engineBadge.description:
Every view's label strip ends in a badge naming its engine (Chromium, Firefox, WebKit);
a click on it chooses another engine for the view's breakpoint (RB-080-33). The canvas
board draws the same badge. Off hides the badge; the chord still opens the choice.

checkUpdatesAtStart.description:
At every start, ask the Web Store whether an installed extension has a newer version;
an update is installed only after confirmation in the window. Off checks only on the
command Extensions: check the Web Store for updates.

profileDir.description:
The folder of rBrowser's Firefox profile, absolute or relative to rBrowser's local folder;
a folder per project in the local folder when empty, never inside the project. A folder
that is not empty and not rBrowser's (a profile of your own Firefox), or a link, is refused.

keys.description:
With the focus in a page, Ctrl+0 sets the view's page zoom back to 100 % and Ctrl+Plus
and Ctrl+Minus zoom it in Chromium's steps, as in Chrome. Off, the keys reach the page;
the commands and the badge in the label strip stay.
